[Composer "Richard Réti"]
[Year "1921"]
[SetUp "1"]
[FEN "7K/8/k1P5/7p/8/8/8/8 w - - 0 1"]

{ The white king seems hopelessly far from the black pawn. It walks two roads at once. } 1. Kg7 $1
{ The king heads for the pawn and towards its own pawn at the same time. } 1... h4 ( 1... Kb6 2.
Kf6 h4 3. Ke5 ) 2. Kf6 Kb6 ( 2... h3 3. Ke7 h2 4. c7 Kb7 5. Kd7 h1=Q 6. c8=Q+
{ Both sides queen: a draw. } ) 3. Ke5 $1 Kxc6 ( 3... h3 4. Kd6 h2 5. c7 Kb7 6. Kd7 h1=Q 7. c8=Q+ )
4. Kf4 { Now the king is inside the square of the pawn. } 4... h3 5. Kg3 h2 6. Kxh2 *

